% ============================================================================
% band-emitter.query — worked recall queries against band-emitter.adj
% (adj-facts-stdlib, PHYSICS).
% ============================================================================
% Three queries: forward recall with citation, backward recall (bind an
% emitter, find the band), and honest abstention on radio (this table is
% honestly narrower than its parent em-spectrum.adj -- only three of the
% seven bands have an emitter stated in the cited spans).
% ============================================================================

import "band-emitter.adj"

% Forward: who emits ultraviolet radiation, per the cited NASA span?
? band_emitter(ultraviolet, $Emitter)

% Backward: which band does the Sun emit?
? band_emitter($Band, sun)

% Honest abstention: radio's cited span states a use (radio stations), not an emitter.
? band_emitter(radio, $EmitterRadio)
